"sdp.admin.dcconfig.software.dcincompatable.message" : "<strong>{0}</strong> v\u0259 ya daha y\u00fcks\u0259k \u0130\u015f masas\u0131 v\u0259 MDM qo\u015fma versiyas\u0131 t\u0259l\u0259b edilir. \u018fn son versiyaya t\u0259kmill\u0259\u015fdirm\u0259k \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn <a style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"{1}\" target=\"_blank\"  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-primary\">vebsayt\u0131m\u0131zdan</a> \u0259n son hotfiksi endirin v\u0259 ya <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"mailto:endpointcentral-support@manageengine.com?subject=Need%20Compatible%20Endpoint%20Central%20Version({0}%20and%20above)%20to%20Integrate%20with%20SDP\" class=\"text-primary\">d\u0259st\u0259k xidm\u0259ti il\u0259 \u0259laq\u0259 saxlay\u0131n</a>",
