"integrations.sccm" : "Microsoft Sistem M\u0259rk\u0259zi Konfiqurasiya Menecerinin (SCCM) t\u0259tbiqimizl\u0259 SCCM-d\u0259n skan edilmi\u015f aktiv m\u0259lumatlar\u0131n\u0131 t\u0259tbiqimiz\u0259 y\u00fckl\u0259diyimiz birt\u0259r\u0259fli inteqrasiyan\u0131 asanla\u015fd\u0131r\u0131r.",
