"sdp.overview.integrations.api.content" : "<p>T\u0259tbiq proqramla\u015fd\u0131rma interfeysi (API) ServiceDesk Plus-u dig\u0259r xarici proqramlarla inteqrasiya etm\u0259y\u0259 k\u00f6m\u0259k edir. Siz API s\u0259viyy\u0259li inteqrasiyalardan istifad\u0259 ed\u0259r\u0259k ServiceDesk Plus v\u0259 dig\u0259r t\u0259tbiql\u0259r aras\u0131nda m\u0259lumatlar\u0131 ke\u00e7ir\u0259 v\u0259 geri g\u00f6t\u00fcr\u0259 bil\u0259rsiniz. ServiceDesk Plus-da API Sor\u011fu, Aktiv, CMDB v\u0259 D\u0259yi\u015fiklik modullar\u0131 t\u0259r\u0259find\u0259n d\u0259st\u0259kl\u0259nir.</p>",
