"project.cost.settings.info" : "Qiym\u0259t parametrl\u0259ri siz\u0259 alt obyektl\u0259rin d\u0259y\u0259rl\u0259rind\u0259n istifad\u0259 ed\u0259r\u0259k layih\u0259nin <strong>Faktiki qiym\u0259t</strong> sah\u0259sinin d\u0259y\u0259rini hesablamaq \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn se\u00e7imi konfiqurasiya etm\u0259y\u0259 imkan verir.",
